# Client-app installers are BINARIES baked into the appliance image at
# build time — they are never committed to this repo (they'd bloat every
# clone and they're built from droplet-windows / droplet-android, not
# here). The image build stages them into this directory and runs
# scripts/app-downloads/gen-catalog.mjs to pin their digests.
#
# Tracked here: only the hand-authored side of the contract and the docs.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!platforms.example.json
